# Build-context filter for packages/cloud/Dockerfile (BuildKit prefers
# <Dockerfile>.dockerignore over the root .dockerignore, which excludes
# packages/cloud because the edge image does not contain it).
**/__pycache__
**/.venv
**/.git
**/.env
**/node_modules
cloud_data
data
LOGS
tests
docs
firmware
README.md
# The cloud image needs neither the edge nor the sims source, only their
# manifests (workspace resolution).
packages/edge/src
packages/sims/src
